.page group 5 the group database

# DESCRIPTION
`/Hakurei/etc/group` lists the groups, one per line, in four fields separated by colons:

    name:password:gid:member,member,...

The members are the users who belong to the group in addition to their primary group, which is given by the fourth field of passwd(5). The shipped file has a group for each of the three residents and the shared group `shrine`:

    root:x:0:root
    reimu:x:1000:reimu
    marisa:x:1001:marisa
    sakuya:x:1002:sakuya
    shrine:x:100:reimu,marisa,sakuya

# SEE ALSO
passwd(5), id(1), groups(1)
